@startuml 02_container_diagram
!includeurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Container.puml

title C4 Level 2 - Container Diagram (As-Is)
LAYOUT_WITH_LEGEND()

Person(customer, "Customer", "Client submitting an order")

System_Boundary(platform, "E-Commerce Cloud Platform") {
    Container(api, "Cloud Platform API", "Java 21, Spring Boot 3.4.3, Embedded Tomcat", "REST endpoint POST /orders; order use case, domain model, in-memory adapters and in-process event consumers")
}

Rel(customer, api, "Submits order", "HTTP/JSON, host port 8081 -> container port 8080")

note right of api
Runtime:
- Docker container: cloud-platform-api
- Application port: 8080
- Host mapping: 8081:8080

In-memory components:
- InMemoryOrderRepository
- InMemoryInventoryAvailabilityAdapter
- InMemoryEventBus
- InMemoryProcessedEventStore

No separate database, cache,
message broker or notification
service is deployed.
end note

SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
